entries.answer:
Tiffany Stratton "TiffyTime" esztétikája egy nagyon specifikus, felismerhető vizuális nyelvezet: hot pink + glitter + Barbie-energia + luxus self-confidence. Az alábbiakban leírom a **tökéletes, ultra-modern, letisztult TiffyTime-inspired iPhone Spa PWA UI/UX design rendszert**, és utána megadom a teljes `index.html` kódot.

***
## A TiffyTime Design Filozófia
Tiffany Stratton brandje nem egyszerűen "rózsaszín dolgok" — ez egy **maximálista luxus minimalizmus**. A WrestleMania 41-es Barbie-box belépőjénél  látható esztétika: neon pink backlight, kristálytiszta fehér felszínek, csillogó arany/ezüst akcentusok, és egy hihetetlenül magabiztos "It's my world, you just live in it" energia. A design rendszer ezt az érzést kell hogy digitálisan lefordítsa.
## Color System & Tokens
A paletta három rétegen alapul. Az **elsődleges réteg** a `#FF2D78` (Tiffy Hot Pink) — ez az igazi WWE entrance-pink, nem a pasztell Barbie-pink. A **másodlagos réteg** egy `#FFB3D1` (Soft Champagne Pink) a kártyák háttereire és a surface elemekre. Az **akcentus réteg** egy `#FFEAF2` (Blush White) a teljes háttérre, kombinálva `#1A0A0E` (Deep Velvet Black/Dark Mode-hoz) változattal. Az arany akcentus `#F5C842` — ez a csillogó belt-buckle arany. A glassmorphism effektekhez `rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.12)` backdrop-blur alapszín kell.
## Typography & Visual Hierarchy
A tipográfia **két fontból áll**. A display fontnak a **Playfair Display** (serif, dőlt) ideális a főcímekhez — ez adja a "luxury spa menu" érzést, amit Tiffy elegáns oldala megkövetel. A body fontnak **Inter** vagy **DM Sans** — ultra-clean, 16px minimum, tökéletes iOS olvashatósággal. A fontméretek iPhone-optimalizált fluid scaling-gel: `clamp(2rem, 8vw, 4rem)` a hero title-nek, `clamp(0.9rem, 3vw, 1.1rem)` a bodynek. A betűköz a prémium logókhoz hasonlóan `letter-spacing: 0.15em` small caps-szel a section labeleken.
## Glass Morphism & Layering
A TiffyTime kártyák **glassmorphism layeringgel** épülnek fel — `backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%)`, `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65)`, `border: 1px solid rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.2)`, és `box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.15)`. Ez az "üvegdoboz a pink fényben" effekt pontosan azt az entrance-ramp vizuált idézi, ahol Tiffy a spotlightban áll.
## Micro-Animations & Motion
A PWA motion designja **iOS-native feel**-t kell kövessen. A hero section egy CSS-only `@keyframes shimmer` animációval rendelkezik, ami egy diagonális glitter-sweep-et szimulál — pontosan mint a WrestleMania 41 Barbie-box csillogása . A CTA gombok `transform: scale(1.03)` hover/active statetel és `transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)` spring-effekttel (ez az iOS "bounce" érzetét adja). A kártyák belépése `animation: slideInUp 0.6s ease forwards` staggerelt delay-jel, minden kártyánál `0.1s`-vel később.
## PWA & iPhone-Native Features
A manifest.json inline a `<head>`-ben data URI-ként beágyazva, `display: standalone`, `theme_color: "#FF2D78"`, `background_color: "#FFEAF2"`, és `orientation: portrait`. A safe area inset-ek kezelése: `padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) env(safe-area-inset-right) env(safe-area-inset-bottom) env(safe-area-inset-left)` — ez biztosítja, hogy a notch és a Dynamic Island ne takarjon el semmit. A service worker inline script-ként cache-eli az oldalt offline működéshez.

***
## A Teljes index.html Kód
Ez egy **önálló, egyetlen fájlba zárt** teljes PWA — nincs külső dependency (Google Fonts CDN-en kívül), nincs JavaScript framework, tiszta vanilla HTML/CSS/JS.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FF2D78" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Tiffy Time" />
  <title>Tiffy Time ✦ Spa</title>

  <!-- PWA Manifest (inline) -->
  /json,{
    &quot;name&quot;:&quot;Tiffy Time Spa&quot;,
    &quot;short_name&quot;:&quot;TiffyTime&quot;,
    &quot;start_url&quot;:&quot;/&quot;,
    &quot;display&quot;:&quot;standalone&quot;,
    &quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;portrait&quot;,
    &quot;background_color&quot;:&quot;#FFEAF2&quot;,
    &quot;theme_color&quot;:&quot;#FF2D78&quot;,
    &quot;icons&quot;:[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='' viewBox='0 0 512 512'%3E%3Crect width='512' height='512' rx='120' fill='%23FF2D78'/%3E%3Ctext x='50%25' y='55%25' dominant-baseline='middle' text-anchor='middle' font-size='280' fill='white'%3E💎%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:&quot;512x512&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/svg+xml&quot;}]
  }" />

  <!-- Apple Touch Icon (inline SVG as data URI) -->
  /svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='' viewBox='0 0 512 512'%3E%3Crect width='512' height='512' rx='120' fill='%23FF2D78'/%3E%3Ctext x='50%25' y='55%25' dominant-baseline='middle' text-anchor='middle' font-size='280' fill='white'%3E%F0%9F%92%8E%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />

  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  //fonts.googleapis.com" />
  //fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  //fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,900;1,400;1,700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    /* ============================================
       DESIGN TOKENS — TiffyTime System
    ============================================ */
    :root {
      --pink-hot:       #FF2D78;
      --pink-soft:      #FFB3D1;
      --pink-blush:     #FFEAF2;
      --pink-deep:      #E8185A;
      --pink-ultra:     #FF6BA8;
      --gold:           #F5C842;
      --gold-soft:      #FFF0A8;
      --white:          #FFFFFF;
      --black:          #1A0A0E;
      --grey-text:      #7A5060;
      --glass-bg:       rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
      --glass-border:   rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.18);
      --glass-shadow:   0 8px 32px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.14);
      --radius-sm:      12px;
      --radius-md:      20px;
      --radius-lg:      32px;
      --radius-pill:    9999px;
      --font-display:   'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      --font-body:      'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      --safe-top:       env(safe-area-inset-top, 20px);
      --safe-bottom:    env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 34px);
      --safe-left:      env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px);
      --safe-right:     env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px);
      --transition:     0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    }

    /* ============================================
       RESET & BASE
    ============================================ */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    html {
      font-size: 16px;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background-color: var(--pink-blush);
      color: var(--black);
      min-height: 100dvh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      padding-top: var(--safe-top);
      padding-bottom: calc(80px + var(--safe-bottom));
      padding-left: var(--safe-left);
      padding-right: var(--safe-right);
    }

    /* ============================================
       ANIMATED BACKGROUND
    ============================================ */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 20% 10%, rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.12) 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 80% 80%, rgba(245, 200, 66, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 179, 209, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: bgPulse 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes bgPulse {
      0%   { opacity: 0.7; }
      100% { opacity: 1; }
    }

    /* ============================================
       SHIMMER KEYFRAME
    ============================================ */
    @keyframes shimmer {
      0%   { background-position: -200% center; }
      100% { background-position: 200% center; }
    }

    @keyframes slideInUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(28px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50%       { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }

    @keyframes sparkle {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50%       { opacity: 0.6; transform: scale(1.3); }
    }

    @keyframes pulse-ring {
      0%   { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
      100% { transform: scale(1.4); opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* ============================================
       TYPOGRAPHY
    ============================================ */
    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .label {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--pink-hot);
    }

    /* ============================================
       STATUS BAR SPACER
    ============================================ */
    .status-bar {
      height: calc(var(--safe-top) + 4px);
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(255, 234, 242, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    }

    /* ============================================
       TOP NAV
    ============================================ */
    .topnav {
      position: fixed;
      top: var(--safe-top);
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: rgba(255, 234, 242, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.1);
    }

    .topnav-logo {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-hot) 0%, var(--gold) 60%, var(--pink-hot) 100%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      animation: shimmer 3s linear infinite;
    }

    .topnav-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .topnav-icon:active {
      transform: scale(0.92);
    }

    /* ============================================
       MAIN SCROLL CONTAINER
    ============================================ */
    .main {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      padding-top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 60px);
    }

    /* ============================================
       HERO SECTION
    ============================================ */
    .hero {
      padding: 32px 20px 24px;
      animation: slideInUp 0.7s ease forwards;
    }

    .hero-greeting {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--pink-hot);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 10vw, 3.5rem);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: var(--black);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .hero-title span {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-hot) 0%, #FF6BA8 40%, var(--gold) 80%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      animation: shimmer 4s linear infinite;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--grey-text);
      margin-top: 10px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* ============================================
       LIVE BADGE
    ============================================ */
    .live-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--pink-hot);
      box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    }

    .live-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--pink-hot);
      position: relative;
    }

    .live-dot::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: -3px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--pink-hot);
      opacity: 0.4;
      animation: pulse-ring 1.5s ease-out infinite;
    }

    /* ============================================
       SECTION HEADER
    ============================================ */
    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 20px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--black);
    }

    .section-link {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--pink-hot);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* ============================================
       FEATURED CARD (horizontal scroll)
    ============================================ */
    .scroll-section {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .scroll-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 4px 20px 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    .scroll-row::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    .featured-card {
      flex: 0 0 72vw;
      max-width: 300px;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #FF6BA8 0%, var(--pink-hot) 50%, #C70054 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.3);
      min-height: 180px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 20px;
      animation: slideInUp 0.7s ease forwards;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
    }

    .featured-card:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.2);
    }

    .featured-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 0%,
        transparent 50%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Shimmer overlay on cards */
    .featured-card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      left: -50%;
      width: 200%;
      height: 200%;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg,
        transparent 40%,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 50%,
        transparent 60%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      animation: shimmer 4s linear infinite;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .featured-card .card-emoji {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .featured-card .card-label {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .featured-card .card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .featured-card .card-price {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--gold-soft);
    }

    /* Card color variants */
    .featured-card.gold {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #F5C842 0%, #E8A800 50%, #B87A00 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(245, 200, 66, 0.3);
    }

    .featured-card.blush {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #FFB3D1 0%, #FF79B0 50%, var(--pink-hot) 100%);
    }

    /* ============================================
       SERVICE GRID
    ============================================ */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .service-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
      box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
      padding: 18px 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
      animation: slideInUp 0.6s ease forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .service-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.10s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.20s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.30s; }

    .service-card:active {
      transform: scale(0.96);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.1);
    }

    .service-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: block;
      animation: sparkle 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .service-card:nth-child(2) .service-icon { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(3) .service-icon { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
    .service-card:nth-child(4) .service-icon { animation-delay: 0.9s; }

    .service-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--black);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .service-desc {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--grey-text);
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .service-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-hot), var(--pink-ultra));
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: white;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* ============================================
       TIFFY TIME CLOCK WIDGET
    ============================================ */
    .tiffy-clock {
      margin: 0 20px 32px;
      padding: 24px 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,
        var(--pink-hot) 0%,
        #D4005A 50%,
        #FF6BA8 100%);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.35);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: slideInUp 0.8s ease forwards;
    }

    .tiffy-clock::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      left: -50%;
      width: 200%;
      height: 200%;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg,
        transparent 40%,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 50%,
        transparent 60%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      animation: shimmer 3s linear infinite;
    }

    .tiffy-clock-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .tiffy-clock-time {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    .tiffy-clock-sub {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .tiffy-clock-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      animation: float 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    /* ============================================
       BOOKING CTA
    ============================================ */
    .booking-cta {
      margin: 0 20px 28px;
      animation: slideInUp 0.9s ease forwards;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-hot) 0%, #D4005A 100%);
      border: none;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: white;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.4), 0 2px 8px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.2);
      transition: transform var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn-primary:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--pink-hot);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--pink-hot);
      cursor: pointer;
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
